SUMMARY:UNSUNG: Celebrating the Extraordinary Grandeur of Smallness
LOCATION:Art Gallery\, Kamaladevi Complex\, IIC\, India International Cen
 tre\, 40 Max Mueller Marg\, Lodhi Gardens\, New Delhi 110003
URL:https://iicdelhi.in/programmes/exhibition-unsung-celebrating-extraord
 inary-grandeur-smallness
DESCRIPTION:UNSUNG: Celebrating the Extraordinary Grandeur of Smallness\n
 A photography exhibition curated by Amit Mehra\, photographer\, curator\,
  and founder of the UNSUNG project\, an ongoing initiative that celebrate
 s the lives and contributions of extraordinary yet often overlooked indiv
 iduals.\nThe photographs explore the beauty and significance of lives\, p
 laces\, and ideas that often go unnoticed. Through visual narratives by c
 ontemporary artists\, the exhibition reflects on ordinary people and unse
 en worlds whose stories reveal resilience\, conviction\, and human connec
 tion.\nThe exhibition will be inaugurated on Tuesday\, 21 July’26 at 18
 :00 hrs by Amb Shyam Saran\, President\, IIC\nThe exhibition will remain 
 open daily from 11:00 to 19:00 hrs\n(Collaboration: Srishti Manipal Insti
 tute of Art\, Design and Technology (a constituent of MAHE\, Manipal) and
  Manipal Academy of Higher Education (MAHE)\, Manipal (Institution of Emi
 nence Deemed to be University)\n\nhttps://iicdelhi.in/programmes/exhibiti
 on-unsung-celebrating-extraordinary-grandeur-smallness
CATEGORIES:exhibition\,art\,photography
END:VEVENT
